    '**THE QUESTION THIS PAGE ANSWERS.** **If I were not here on Monday, what would nobody know? Six items came out of it. None is a secret, none is written down anywhere, and five would be discovered by a successor at a cost of between a day and a month each.**',
    '**TWO THAT SOUND TOO SMALL TO WRITE.** **The Homs storekeeper answers the telephone before eight in the morning and not after four, and does not answer at all on the day of a delivery. The Latakia count sheets come by hand with the Thursday van, not by email, so a count asked for on a Friday arrives the following Thursday.**',
