      b: 'Yes, and the sentence admitting it belongs in the page rather than being softened: a successor who meets an unexplained basis difference in November has to choose between two figures with nothing to choose on. The page is the only one nobody else could write, and editing it for dignity is the one thing that would make it worthless.',
